<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capstone Pharmacy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capstone Pharmacy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Ed Kroll started coverage of Capstone Pharmacy Services Inc as strong buy, his office said.</p>
<p>-- Kroll was not available for further details.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/16 to 12-3/16.</p>
</text>
